  "body": [
    "A linear park along the former Porta Genova rail yard in Milan, running from the street down to the Naviglio. The existing goods shed is retained and reopened as a market hall, with a colonnade added along its length.",
    "The park is organized as a sequence of rooms — a sculpture court, a lawn with an open-air screen, growing houses among the planting beds, and a pine grove — ending at steps down to the water."
